  "fullDescription": "Add adorable charm to your projects with this Cute Camping Duck Clipart Bundle! This fun collection features sweet little ducks enjoying camping adventures — roasting marshmallows by the campfire, fishing, reading, relaxing in a tent, watching the stars, and exploring the outdoors. Each illustration is designed in a playful kawaii style with bright, cheerful colors and clean outlines.\n\nPerfect for kids’ designs, sublimation projects, stickers, planners, scrapbooking, t-shirts, mugs, and print-on-demand products. Whether you’re creating camping-themed merchandise or cute nursery decor, these camping ducks bring warmth and personality to every project.\n\nWhat’s Included:\n\n✅ 1 × PNG File – 4500 × 5400 px – High Resolution – Transparent Background\n✅ Ready for sublimation, printing & digital crafting\n\nPerfect For:\n\n– Kids camping shirts\n– Cute outdoor stickers\n– Sublimation designs\n– Scrapbooking & planners\n– Nursery wall art\n– Camping party decor\n– Printable crafts\n– Print-on-demand products\n\n✅ Note:\n\n✨ Instant digital download – no physical item will be shipped\n✨ Colors may vary slightly due to monitor and printer settings",
